        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A transcriptomically distinct central nervous system macrophage found in the parenchyma of the central nervous system. Marker include CD11b-positive, F4/80-positive, and CD68-positive.</owl:annotatedTarget>
