        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A precursor in the monocytic series, being a cell intermediate in development between the monoblast and monocyte. This cell is CD11b-positive and has fine azurophil granules.</owl:annotatedTarget>
