        <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Memory B-cells are also reportedly CD5-negative, CD10-negative, CD21-positive, CD22-positive, CD23-negative, CD24-positive, CD25-positive, CD27-positive, CD34-negative, CD38-negative, CD40-positive, CD43-negative, CD44-positive, CD45-positive, CD53-positive, CD80-negative, CD81-negative, CD86-positive, and CD196/CCR6-positive.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/cl.owl"/>
