        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">An immature B cell of an intermediate stage between the pre-B cell stage and the mature naive stage with the phenotype surface IgM-positive and CD19-positive, and are subject to the process of B cell selection. A transitional B cell migrates from the bone marrow into the peripheral circulation, and then to the spleen.</owl:annotatedTarget>
