        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A macrophage that is part of the lung connective tissue (pulmonary interstitium). This cell performs tissue remodeling and contributes to barrier immunity through antigen presentation.</obo:IAO_0000115>
