        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A transcriptomically distinct GABAergic neuron, located in the cerebral cortex and derived from the CGE, that expresses the transcript PAX6.</obo:IAO_0000115>
