        <obo:IAO_0000028 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Exc L2 LAMP5 KCNG3 M1 (Human)</obo:IAO_0000028>
        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A glutamatergic neuron of the Homo sapiens primary motor cortex. These cells can be distinguished from other cells in the primary motor cortex by their selective expression of LOC101927668 (Hsap), FAM163A (Hsap), SAMD3 (Hsap). These cells also express LAMP5 (Hsap), KCNG3 (Hsap). The soma of these cells in located in: cortical layer II. The reference data for this cell type is CS201912131_73.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:PCL_0010058 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">FAM163A (Hsap)</obo:PCL_0010058>
