        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A microglial cell of the Homo sapiens brain. These cells can be distinguished from other cells in the brain by their selective expression of SRGN (Hsap), HIF1A-AS3 (Hsap). The soma of these cells can be found in the spinal cord, pons, myelencephalon. The reference data for this cell type is CS202210140_5.</obo:IAO_0000115>
