        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A C-shaped bundle of fibres (axons) in the brain, and carries signals from the hippocampus to the mammillary bodies and septal nuclei. It is typically divided into the columns (crus), body, commissure and the pre-commissural and post-commissural fornix (MM).</obo:IAO_0000115>
