        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">An adductor muscle that attaches to the hip and femur. In humans, it is a part of the adductor group of the thigh, that as the name suggests adducts the thigh. The adductor longus muscle forms the medial wall of the femoral triangle[WP, generalized].</obo:IAO_0000115>
