        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A plexus of autonomic nerve fibers within the wall of the digestive tube, and made up of the submucosal, myenteric, and subserosal plexuses; it contains visceral afferent fibers, sympathetic postganglionic fibers, parasympathetic preganglionic and postganglionic fibers, and parasympathetic postganglionic cell bodies.</obo:IAO_0000115>
