        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A basal lamina is certainly present in Bilateria and was evaluated as an autapomorphy of this taxon.[well established][VHOG]</owl:annotatedTarget>
