        <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">EDITOR_NOTE we follow MP in identifying the &apos;parotid duct&apos; with the main excretory duct, although in fact the parotid has many other ducts of different types</rdfs:comment>
