        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The serratus ventralis is a muscle that originates on the surface of the upper eight or nine ribs at the side of the chest and inserts along the entire anterior length of the medial border of the scapula. [WP,unvetted].</obo:IAO_0000115>
