        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Each (left and right) superior suprarenal artery is a branch of the inferior phrenic artery on that side of the body. The left and right phrenic arteries supply the diaphragm, and come off the aorta. [WP,unvetted].</owl:annotatedTarget>
