        <obo:UBPROP_0000001 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A tuft of capillaries found in a Bowman&apos;s capsule in which waste products are filtered from the blood and urine formation is initiated. Paired highly vascularized structures of the pronephros, responsible for blood filtration.[XAO]</obo:UBPROP_0000001>
