        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">MP treats ureter urothelium and ureter luminal urothelium as exact synonyms, yes MA treats these as distinct; see also: transitional epithelium vs urothelium</owl:annotatedTarget>
