        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The Sphincter ani externus (external anal sphincter) is a flat plane of muscular fibers, elliptical in shape and intimately adherent to the integument surrounding the margin of the anus. [WP,unvetted].</obo:IAO_0000115>
