        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The arteria profunda brachii (also known as deep artery of the arm and the deep brachial artery) is a large vessel which arises from the medial and back part of the brachial, just below the lower border of the Teres major. [WP,unvetted].</obo:IAO_0000115>
