        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">we place the MA and EMAPA class here, although the intent is probably a smaller region. See https://github.com/obophenotype/uberon/issues/509</owl:annotatedTarget>
