        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Pharyngeal arch 1 muscle that is innervated by the deep temporal branches of the trigeminal nerve and attaches to the wall of the braincase (including the cranial vault) and mandible.</obo:IAO_0000115>
