        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A major lymphatic vessel that drains lymph from the lower body, left appendage, and left thorax into the junction of the left jugular and subclavian veins.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000116 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">placement of the ZFA class here is dubious</obo:IAO_0000116>
