        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">One of the dural venous sinuses and drains the superior sagittal sinus the occipital sinus and the straight sinus, and empties into the sigmoid sinus which in turn reaches the jugular bulb.</owl:annotatedTarget>
