        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Cranial nerve that branches into the ramus communicans (to the skin), the pretrematic (to the walls of the pharynx and mouth, viscero-sensory fibers), and the larval post-trematic branch (lost in the adult).</obo:IAO_0000115>
