        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A nerve that arises from the caudal cervical nerves and is primarily the motor nerve of the diaphragm but also sends sensory fibers to the pericardium.</obo:IAO_0000115>
