        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A vessel through which blood circulates in the body.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000116 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">consider adopting the EMAPA superclass &apos;vascular element&apos;, which includes microvasculature (e.g. capillaries), vascular plexus</obo:IAO_0000116>
