        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The presence of paired evaginated hemispheres and olfactory bulbs in both agnathan and gnathostome radiations suggests that such hemispheres were also present in the common ancestor.[well established][VHOG]</owl:annotatedTarget>
