        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Part of the ventricular system of the brain, forming a single large cavity in the midline of the diencephalon; it is continuous with the lateral ventricles through the interventricular foramen and the fourth ventricle through the cerebral aqueduct. (Maryann Martone).</obo:IAO_0000115>
