        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">As in birds, the conus arteriosus split during embryonic development in mammals to produce the pulmonary trunk and single aortic trunk of the adult.[well established][VHOG]</owl:annotatedTarget>
