        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Portion of tissue that consists of mesodermally derived cells and intercellular matrix comprised of protein fibers and carbohydrates, which supports, ensheathes and binds together other tissues.[TAO]</owl:annotatedTarget>
