        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Fibres resembling a ribbon and arranged in very thin plates in the lens. [Dorian_AF, Elsevier&apos;s_encyclopaedic_dictionary_of_medicine, Part_B:_Anatomy_(1988)_Amsterdam_etc.:_Elsevier][VHOG]</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:date_retrieved rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">2012-09-17</oboInOwl:date_retrieved>
