        <oboInOwl:source rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">ISBN:978-0072528305 Kardong KV, Vertebrates: Comparative Anatomy, Function, Evolution (2006) p.187</oboInOwl:source>
