        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The small spherical bodies of epithelial cells found in the medulla of the thymus, that are arranged in a concentric pattern around clusters of degenerating lymphocytes, eosinophils and macrophages.</owl:annotatedTarget>
