        <oboInOwl:ontology rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">VHOG</oboInOwl:ontology>
        <oboInOwl:source rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">DOI:10.1016/j.ydbio.2005.04.035 Yee NS, Lorent K, Pack M, Exocrine pancreas development in zebrafish. Developmental Biology (2005)</oboInOwl:source>
