        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A dilated sac at the lower end of the thoracic duct into which lymph from the intestinal trunk and two lumbar lymphatic trunks flow.</obo:IAO_0000115>
