        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A circular hole in the sphenoid bone that connects the middle cranial fossa and the pterygopalatine fossa.vity. [Wikipedia:Foramen_rotundum][VHOG]</owl:annotatedTarget>
