        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">It is suggested that the mammalian lamina ascendens arose from an upgrowth of the root of the quadrate ramus of the epipterygoid in cynodonts, separating foramen rotundum from foramen ovale.[well established][VHOG]</owl:annotatedTarget>
