        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The second arch becomes the hyoid artery, which is prominent in early development and normally persists as the caroticotympanic branch of the ICA[Padget].</obo:IAO_0000115>
