        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A thick, horizontal process of the maxilla. It forms the anterior three quarters of the hard palate, the horizontal plate of the palatine bone making up the rest.</obo:IAO_0000115>
