        <obo:UBPROP_0000012 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">in FMA this is not placed under thyro-arytenoid but almost all sources consider this to be the case (confirmed with FEED:rd)</obo:UBPROP_0000012>
