        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The transversus menti, or transverse muscle of the chin, is a facial muscle that is often considered to be the superficial fibers of the depressor anguli oris muscle which cross to the other side of the face.</obo:IAO_0000115>
