        <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Lymph flows into the medullary sinuses from cortical sinuses, and into efferent lymphatic vessels. Medullary sinuses contain histiocytes (immobile macrophages) and reticular cells.[WP]</rdfs:comment>
