        <obo:UBPROP_0000011 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The lateral lingual swellings grow and fuse with eachother, encompassing the tuberculum impar to provide the ectodermally derived mucosa of the anterior 2/3 of the tongue</obo:UBPROP_0000011>
