        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">On the dorsal border of the wing of the ilium , at it&apos;s junction with the shaft is a cut away. This forms the Greater sciatic notch. The sciatic nerve runs over the notch in passage to the hindlimb.</owl:annotatedTarget>
