        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The supraorbital artery is an artery of the head. It springs from the ophthalmic artery as that vessel is crossing over to the medial side of the optic nerve.</owl:annotatedTarget>
