        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The posterior ethmoidal foramen opens at the back part of this margin under cover of the projecting lamina of the sphenoid, and transmits the posterior ethmoidal vessels and nerve.</obo:IAO_0000115>
