        <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">This artery is not usually described in modern anatomy textbooks. Instead, it is described that the superior vesical artery may exist as multiple vessels that arise from a common origin</rdfs:comment>
